      },
      "text": "PREVALENCE: ~5–8% of the population has an autoimmune disease\n  ~80 recognized autoimmune diseases; 70% of patients are female\n  Annual cost in US: >$100 billion (disability + treatment)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-AUTOIMMUNITY.md#004",
